Authenticated reveal chrome uses `docs/28`. Do not paint tenant Delivery sites with Vector identity. Do not treat `docs/28` as the Creative Engine.

Do not create a parallel funnel engine or creative engine.

Use:
business truth → page narrative → visual-direction manifests → validated component variants → deterministic render → candidate score → selected winner → winner-only premium media generation → First Reveal Gate → client reveal

